{"server":"en","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_06_end","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_06","title":"Free From Dream","storyCode":"DV-6","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"d075875311b09cb82a16d31f5b47bad98ffd459f9d7b815c2063b75a93142cb0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...Sonny."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We did this of our own volition."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't get it, Doc Moore... who are you talking for here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Message."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I received a message, one that is different from that previous ones."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hngh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Does your head hurt again, Joyce?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There is nothing wrong with me physically, Dr. Silence."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Detecting unexpected data transmission. Processing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Data?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes... Sonny, we all know..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is... a gamble."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The results are... unpredictable. But this was our choice."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Data transmission terminated. Analysis indicates that Sonny is the intended recipient."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Doc Moore, you're talking like one of our... no, one of the test subjects lying there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hypothesis cannot be confirmed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The source of the data is unknown. I simply sensed it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Doc Silence, is she right? Doc Moore can hear my friends?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Joyce, was your use of the word 'sense' intentional?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, Dr. Silence."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The content of the dream has changed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What did you see?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Analysis failed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your eyes look different... are you feeling sad?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Detecting signal fluctuations in peripheral system."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...Della."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dellareed? Are you thinking of her again? Does Device #9 have something to do with Director Franks's experiments?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Motive, emotion, not logical connections."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Silence, I sense that this was our own choice."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your own choice?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sonny, if I guarantee that I will do all that can be done to correct the wrongs, will you let Dorothy Franks go?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Listen, Doc Silence, we appreciate your help getting us here, and that you got us to the truth about the experiments."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We can definitely believe you're on our side."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But can you really be sure she won't start it all back up again?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No, I can't."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But if she does, I will handle her for you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Whew... the experiments have been suspended, Dorothy is unharmed, and the test subjects are regaining consciousness."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I still find all this hard to believe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There is no cause for alarm. Emotional fluctuations are normal."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You woke up just in time, Joyce."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I've never seen Olivia that angry... I thought she would just leave Dorothy to her own devices."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But I still don't understand how you heard the voices of the test subjects."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Their consciousnesses were linked by Dorothy's 'Hub', but how did you get involved?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Didn't you say Device #9 had nothing to do with the 'Hub'?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Insufficient data available."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But I heard the voice of Mr. Myers when I woke up from my dream."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"When you woke up..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The conflict in the corridor? Why would that wake you, when the battle before didn't?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is all so strange..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Anyway, I guess all's well that ends well. Thanks to Olivia."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Silence has met expectations."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"She's changed so much, come to think of it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"When I first met her, she was just one of many students you'd see on a college campus, shy, introverted, unremarkable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This description matches my memory."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I could hardly recognize her when she was pressing Dorothy for answers, only to step in to protect her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It was like I saw... a shadow of someone else."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That of Director Saria?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"H-How did you know?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't tell Olivia I said that!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Silence won't let this affect her friendship with you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But as her friend, I don't want to remind her of her unpleasant past."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go. I should finish my job too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Communications have yet to be restored... not good. The boss..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"And my sister... how many messages have I been getting?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Please come with me, Director Franks. It's time to leave."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"One moment, please."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"With the experiments halted, they will wipe this lab off the map."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There's something I have to take with me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's... a photo?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A photo of a group of Pioneers..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is this girl... you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I meant every word I said to Sonny."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"My mother, my whole family... they were all Pioneers."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"From a young age I heard them talk about their dreams and saw their struggles with my own eyes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They gave me a chance to chase my own dreams."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But most Pioneers will never know the luck that came to me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What happened to your family?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Most of them have left me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"When I was invited to attend Ironforge Polytechnic's summer camp for 'talented students'..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A Catastrophe destroyed my mother's camp."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"She never heard about my miraculous acceptance, or my scholarship."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Was it really the right choice to stop these experiments?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Those Pioneers, those whose lives hang by a thread, they live each day not knowing if they'll see the next."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I could have helped them..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dorothy","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They didn't have to be swallowed up by the sand in despair, like my family was."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Parvis","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Why do you ask this, Silence?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Parvis","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Without our experiments, the child would not have lasted more than a few days after leaving Haydn 1."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Parvis","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We saved her life. She wants for nothing, and will contribute to scientific advancement."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Parvis","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How lucky is she, compared to all those children who die of Oripathy in the barrenlands?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Parvis","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I trusted you, put you in charge of her. Yet you make such petty accusations towards me, towards science itself?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is not a question for me to answer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Joyce reminded me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I should not judge things by my own standards, even if I can never accept what you did."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Did we not choose to be tormented by uncertainty and self-doubt?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Silence","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"As researchers, it's our duty to seek the answer ourselves."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is everything ready?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Our team has entered the site and is approaching the lab area."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Good. Get ready."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Colonel, I know there have been delays, but if you give me a little more time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Colonel's Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You never told me there were other people at the site, Clooney."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you mean the pharmaceutical company?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There's nothing to worry about. They're partnered with Rhine Lab. I will..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Colonel's Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I don't need your promises."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Colonel's Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"All I need here is results."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I apologize. This is just a small hiccup..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Colonel's Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"If you can't deliver results, then you have to at least stop making trouble for me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Colonel's Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You'd do well to remember that."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Can we proceed, Director Clooney?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We don't have a choice."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"One more thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Put me on spec com."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh... communications have been restored?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Elena."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Director?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm so glad it's you. I've been trying to reach you... did you get my message? I put everything that happened here in my report."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Something's wrong with Dorothy... Director Franks's experiments. But Silence and I have things under control."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We've settled things with the Pioneers. They're leaving the labs as we speak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You... you do? Oh wow..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You did your job. The cleanup detail is on the way in."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Defense? They're finally here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Whew, that's a relief. I was worried about the Transmitter we've been storing here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"They know what to do. You can leave now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I should stay and help. Next to Dorothy, I'm the most familiar with these experiments."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I'm at the observation station, Elena. Two directors are more than enough to handle the situation, don't you agree?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Er, that's not what I meant..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Then listen to me and leave the site immediately."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"May I ask why?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"No, you may not waste my time with meaningless questions. I want you in the control room, now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes... sir."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is there a problem, Researcher Urbica?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The director... Ferdinand wants me to leave immediately."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Leave?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Go and let Olivia know that the Defense Section is coming."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ptilopsis","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What about you? Are you leaving?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I... something's not right with the director. If... if he didn't know how far Dorothy went, why is he completely unconcerned about what happened to the experiments?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Director Clooney, Miss Urbica is not leaving the labs."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Should we adjust the plan?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ferdinand","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Proceed."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is everybody out?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pioneer Team Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, sir."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Next."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What are they doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pioneer Team Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They say it's a 'precautionary measure'. Probably a sedative or something."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pioneer Team Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I guess we made a little too much noise, huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't forget what I said. If anyone asks, I was the one behind everything."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pioneer Team Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry, no one's letting you take all the credit."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Next."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sonny Romano."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Wasn't asking for your name."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Tell your leader that I take sole responsibility for the kidnapping."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Right hand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you gonna get to it after the injection?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What the...? Doc Urbica? Why'd you push me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't take the shot!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rhine Defense Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're interfering with our work, researcher."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I developed that stuff in that syringe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Need me to explain what it's for?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? Aren't they with you and Doc Silence?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Why do you always doubt the people you should trust, when you're so eager to trust people you should doubt?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Take that band off, quick!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The treatment wristband?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I remembered why Joyce woke up when I saw the syringes in their hands!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's this—the treatment bands!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The ones you got have been modified. There's a sensor on them similar to the equipment in Dorothy's lab. If it comes into contact with Transmitter..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I need to report to the director. Someone is behind all this, using... using..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dammit, communications are down again?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What's the matter?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I get it now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"All this time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sonny","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Doc Urbica, are you okay? Are you crying?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Crying? No, I just..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not important."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elena","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This isn't over, Sonny. Dorothy was never your enemy!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
